# usrmanage

Read and follow [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for this repository.

Key invariants: OpenWrt-default password policy until Save; passwords never on argv/logs/MCP; LuCI `expect: { '': {…} }`; no unquoted `$*` into privileged CLI; prefer flock for locks.

Testing: host `./scripts/smoke-host.sh` (PR CI); QEMU lab `:8080`/`:2222`; Playwright MCP (`.cursor/mcp.json`) + `./scripts/playwright-luci.sh` local only — see [docs/developer/testing.md](docs/developer/testing.md).

Release: third-octet `PKG_VERSION`, tag `v*`, no secrets in git — see [docs/release.md](docs/release.md).
